<p>				   EPS	  n/a     41.7-52.6     43.9</p>
<p>Southern	     I	 PFT	111.0    102.0-120.0   127.8</p>
<p>Electric			 DIV	 12.6     11.3-12.6     10.5</p>
<p>United     ****    I	 PFT	234.7    220.0-249.0   167.0</p>
<p>Utilities			DIV	 12.5     10.6-12.5	9.3</p>
