<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>** The British Gas figures are for net historic income.</p>
<p>*** In the year covered by the Royal Bank of Scotland</p>
<p>forecasts the group posted extraordinary income of around</p>
<p>70.0 million stg from the disposal of CC Holdings and</p>
<p>a restructuring charge of around $35.0 million</p>
<p>in the U.S.</p>
<p>**** In the period covered by the United Utilities forecasts</p>
<p>the company registered extraordinary income from disposals.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items</p>
<p>unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends</p>
<p>are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
